[{:db/id "q-51253/selection/7f2a862922e27122da301724aa8e34e903727c8c9ab5f1f7ae195b8dcf74fca9" :answer/id #uuid "c385bbb3-ad7d-5d2b-a5bd-1e1fe190b479" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x=0$, $x=\\pm 2$ and $x=3$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-51253/selection/fc01e83cbc0a91221270553ac2afbd8c6a7c87ced1ce0529b4dbc53f926f7026" :answer/id #uuid "cf6e48be-e7ce-5aa7-ae12-adb794b1f3d5" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x=0$ and $x=3$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-51253/selection/f2099ec612a8ba2ad1232fc0698fe5c14c2ca2169a9927b8ddd0c140cf8bf767" :answer/id #uuid "7683b4df-c3ac-56a9-a427-0f00ca981f4c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x=-2$ and $x=0$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-51253/selection/517b13fa7d7411493417798333c215e538be20515774e23158b4c71536604686" :answer/id #uuid "0013fc75-105f-51bf-b236-1b455c694d4f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x=0$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-51253/selection/5bd371628756a1972f75ca38d3e39c656441c0a7b78ffa79d496f40f644448ca" :answer/id #uuid "954c1556-51b7-5e5c-a75d-185d2ae85f6c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x=0$, $x=2$ and $x=3$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-51253/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "dbe501a8-801b-5b97-9881-09e4fc4d22d3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-51253/selection/517b13fa7d7411493417798333c215e538be20515774e23158b4c71536604686" :answer-field/choices ["q-51253/selection/7f2a862922e27122da301724aa8e34e903727c8c9ab5f1f7ae195b8dcf74fca9" "q-51253/selection/fc01e83cbc0a91221270553ac2afbd8c6a7c87ced1ce0529b4dbc53f926f7026" "q-51253/selection/f2099ec612a8ba2ad1232fc0698fe5c14c2ca2169a9927b8ddd0c140cf8bf767" "q-51253/selection/517b13fa7d7411493417798333c215e538be20515774e23158b4c71536604686" "q-51253/selection/5bd371628756a1972f75ca38d3e39c656441c0a7b78ffa79d496f40f644448ca"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-51253" :question/id #uuid "3a15760c-3531-560b-9465-64e8a627b33c" :question/math-academy-id "q-51253" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14038344/assets/7d71b69f27d14ca6c9ff0467ecce1df7be2f53684b162a316dc8877218b202ca.png)\n\nConsider the graph of $y=f(x)$ above. What are the points of inflection?" :question/worked-solution "The points of inflection are the points where\n\n- the function's concavity changes sign, and\n\n- the tangent line to the graph exists.\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine our graph.\n\n- The point $x=-2$ is not a point of inflection. Although the graph changes concavity from concave up to concave down at $x=-2,$   the function is not defined at this point, so the tangent line does not exist either.\n\n- The point $x=0$ is a point of inflection. Indeed:\n\n- the graph changes concavity from concave down to concave up at $x=0,$ and\n\n- the tangent line exists at this point\n\n- The point $x=2$ is *not* a point of inflection for two reasons. First, the function does not change concavity. It's concave up both to the left and to the right of $x=2.$ Second, the tangent line does not exist at this point.\n\n- The point $x=3$ is *not* a point of inflection for two reasons. First, the function does not change concavity. It's concave up both to the left and to the right of $x=3.$ Second, the tangent line does not exist at this point.\n\nTherefore, the point of inflection is $x=0$ only." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-51253/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0099e032-f2ee-573a-a359-cf60e28bc89e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-51253"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-127112/selection/483e7314b7e91870e67cf06a88a29e4311cd8f6702748ab8cca9bb83e249a7a8" :answer/id #uuid "dbda536a-a30e-52c7-884c-a13f44e27330" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x=-1$ and $x=0$" 