ave down to concave up at $x=0,$ and\n\n- the tangent line exists at this point.\n\n- The point $x=1$  is *not* a point of inflection for two reasons. First, the function does not change concavity. It's concave up both to the left and to the right of $x=1.$ Second, the tangent line does not exist at this point.\n\n- The point $x=2$ is *not* a point of inflection for two reasons. First, the function does not change concavity. It's concave up both to the left and to the right of $x=2.$ Second, the function is not defined at this point, so the tangent line does not exist either.\n\nTherefore, the point of inflection is $x=0$ only." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-51423/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0099e032-f2ee-573a-a359-cf60e28bc89e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-51423"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-114404/selection/f5174cb54b1bb0397f26fea29ab3f6b9491c5ea8c10056e9e738b9a4c163cd13" :answer/id #uuid "fe0a9a2f-073f-5bbc-b545-28af755c893b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x=0,$ $x=1,$ and $x=2$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114404/selection/84ea79387d51fde1e84146322c8639e6e5eae9a28be16c7c74f23a3fe78716de" :answer/id #uuid "b540a420-c4e6-51d4-86d2-bcac80d042f0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "There are no points of inflection" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114404/selection/a805ab83f20e0c8452492867e579f5d06691ac2f34d7f01e6bd5ff749ea2f457" :answer/id #uuid "51526fb8-c340-5715-8138-057213541ef9" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x=1$ and $x=2$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114404/selection/517b13fa7d7411493417798333c215e538be20515774e23158b4c71536604686" :answer/id #uuid "222934c1-158c-5d7c-bed8-961584e11904" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x=0$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114404/selection/1288db97e8c08fe1e59253bc39f36416fd21e4daf73730ee4bb5a